==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|softnesse}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sōftnes}}, alteration of earlier {{m|ang|sēftnes}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|soft|ness}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɔftnəs/}}
* {{a|cot-caught|Canada}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɑftnəs/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɒftnəs/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-softness.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}}

# The [[quality]] of being [[soft]].

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|hardness}}

